<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>HighMap<sp/>Documentation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">HighMap<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>C++<sp/>library<sp/>for<sp/>procedural<sp/>generation,<sp/>simulation,<sp/>and<sp/>analysis<sp/>of<sp/>2D<sp/>heightmaps<sp/>and<sp/>terrain<sp/>assets.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">A<sp/>heightmap<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>two-dimensional<sp/>grid<sp/>of<sp/>elevation<sp/>values.<sp/>Each<sp/>cell<sp/>corresponds<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>spatial<sp/>position,<sp/>with<sp/>values<sp/>typically<sp/>normalized<sp/>to<sp/>$[0,<sp/>1]$<sp/>or<sp/>expressed<sp/>in<sp/>world<sp/>elevation<sp/>units.</highlight></codeline>
